<title>BELGIUM: French ActivCard Q1 loss per share narrows yr/yr.</title>
<headline>French ActivCard Q1 loss per share narrows yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997 versu first quarter 1996. In thousand of dollars excepts share data.</p>
<p>    Loss per ordinary share		  $0.19   vs $0.22 loss</p>
<p>    Net loss after minority interest   2,966     vs   2,596 loss</p>
<p>    Net loss before minority interest  2,990     vs   2,596 loss</p>
<p>NOTE - ActivCard is a French smart card maker listed on Easdaq.</p>
</text>
